  "description": "Chiria – Street Decorative Display\nChiria is a bold, decorative street-style font inspired by urban culture, graffiti art, and the raw energy of street expression. \nFeaturing organic brushstrokes and dynamic letterforms, this font delivers a strong, expressive, and rebellious visual style.\nEach character feels hand-drawn, giving the design a strong personality and eye-catching impact. Chiria is perfect for posters, streetwear branding, music covers, logos, headlines, social media graphics, and creative projects that want to stand out with a modern, urban attitude.\nIts decorative style makes it ideal for bold statements and visually striking designs.\nPUA encoding ensures that all stylistic features and extras can be used with just a few clicks.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Chiria – Street Decorative Display</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Chiria is a bold, decorative street-style font inspired by urban culture, graffiti art, and the raw energy of street expression. </strong></p>\n<p>Featuring organic brushstrokes and dynamic letterforms, this font delivers a strong, expressive, and rebellious visual style.</p>\n<p>Each character feels hand-drawn, giving the design a strong personality and eye-catching impact. Chiria is perfect for posters, streetwear branding, music covers, logos, headlines, social media graphics, and creative projects that want to stand out with a modern, urban attitude.</p>\n<p>Its decorative style makes it ideal for bold statements and visually striking designs.</p>\n<p><strong>PUA encoding ensures that all stylistic features and extras can be used with just a few clicks.</strong></p>",
